!Cheatsheets
  Reference documents to help memorize different aspects of Lojban.

((IRC cheat sheet))
!!General Concepts
*   __Lojban grammar words__ . A ''mind map'' of lojban words commonly used when discussing about lojban grammar. [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=746|PNG], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=747|PNG (hi-res)], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=748|Source (Tony Buzan's iMandMap)]

!!Cmavo
*   __Space/Time tenses__. A 4 pages booklet with mnemonic illustration. [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=726|PDF], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=727|Source (OpenOffice)]
*   __pro-sumti and pro-bridi__. A ''periodic table'' of cmavo. [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=746|PDF], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=747|PNG], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=748|Source (OpenOffice)]
